{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"michelle-lee","name":"Michelle Lee","birthDate":"1978-08-02","birthPlace":"Long Beach, California, USA","bio":"Michelle Charlene Lee has appeared in many films and television series such as Pirates of the Caribbean: At Worlds End (2007), Venom (2018), and Black Widow (2021), just to name a few. Michelle's ability to show strength through both acting and physicality has been recognized with a SAG Nomination for Best Ensemble Cast and on the cover of Inside Kung Fu Magazine. Michelle has a black belt in Wushu and a BA in Economics specializing in Computer Programming from UCLA.\n\nA native of Los Angeles, Michelle spent some time in Silicon Valley but currently resides back in LA.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:27:51+00:00","tmdbId":101065,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/101065","credits":[{"id":"black-widow","title":"Black Widow","character":"Oksana"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/michelle-lee.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Liza: A Truly Terrific Absolutely True Story","year":2025,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xQG9oxaSe7BVOIlp4MvAgqyGW7p.jpg"},{"name":"Plane","year":2023,"character":"Isabella Yu","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oJRsTQR47pyjSJCZYpOfbycpNBR.jpg"},{"name":"Tiger 3","year":2023,"character":"General Zimou","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7wgED7Yx9VLcNWSO91VgwicHmMD.jpg"},{"name":"Lioness","year":2023,"character":"Nurse","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rzpHPSEgPTpRs8EHbygwsOw7jC0.jpg"},{"name":"Bullet Train","year":2022,"character":"Watchful Nurse","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/j8szC8OgrejDQjjMKSVXyaAjw3V.jpg"},{"name":"California Love","year":2021,"character":"Lisa Yuen","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iG2OG2KheD3JFiZjAzVI7RtBVw.jpg"},{"name":"Black Widow","year":2021,"character":"Oksana","mediaTy